Summary:
Today’s session involved selecting the project topic, Multi-Vendor E-commerce Platform, and initiating the planning phase as per the given timeline. The core objective and key features of the system were reviewed to understand how the platform will support multiple vendors and customers. Initial planning focused on identifying the main modules such as Customer, Vendor, and Admin, along with the required technology stack including React, Node.js, Express, and MongoDB. A basic roadmap was outlined to align the development process with the scheduled milestones.

Outcomes:
A clear project direction was established with a well-defined understanding of objectives, features, and modules. The technology stack and development approach were finalized, ensuring alignment with project requirements. An initial plan was created to guide upcoming phases like requirement analysis and development. This session set up a structured starting point for executing the project effectively.
